                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "113947a9-12f7-3419-8ddb-cb4ae58f607e",
                        "entry_id": "3ebbdb71-2bb8-31fe-a116-35172b216166",
                        "glosses": [
                            "sledge"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "plural-only"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ef6c5fb-1c5a-42e8-9280-f5847140dac2",
                                "sense_id": "113947a9-12f7-3419-8ddb-cb4ae58f607e",
                                "text": "Все предме́ты на́чали принима́ть невероя́тные, огро́мные разме́ры и очерта́ния: на́ши сала́зки торча́ли как корабе́льный о́стов; заиндеве́лая до́хлая соба́ка каза́лась спя́щим бе́лым медве́дем, а дере́вья как бы о́жили и ста́ли переходи́ть с ме́ста на ме́сто...",
                                "translation": "Every object assumed extraordinary and huge proportions and outlines; our little sledge looked like the hull of a ship, the frost-covered carcass of the dead dog looked like a sleeping white bear; while the trees appeared to have come to life and were moving about from place to place. . . .",
                                "english": "Every object assumed extraordinary and huge proportions and outlines; our little sledge looked like the hull of a ship, the frost-covered carcass of the dead dog looked like a sleeping white bear; while the trees appeared to have come to life and were moving about from place to place. . . ."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
